##Page 3 Introduction
xp_furniture:book.contents.13=§l获得家具§r
xp_furniture:book.contents.14=可使用工作台配方书查看生存模式下可制作的家具，也可在创造模式物品栏中取得。

##Page 4 Debug Hammer
xp_furniture:book.contents.15=§l锤子§r
xp_furniture:book.contents.16=用于设置方块状态的工具；在生存或创造模式下按攻击键可立即拆除家具。与目标方块交互可循环切换不同状态；潜行时交互可将上次选定的状态应用到方块。

## [ ] increment page numbers in comments
## [ ] increment text content +2
## [ ] increment actual text comment in structure SNBT

##Page 5 Introduction
xp_furniture:book.contents.17=§l家具商人§r
xp_furniture:book.contents.18=一位新商人来到你的世界！他造访时，别错过他的家具、作物和植物交易。

##Page 6 2.0 Update
xp_furniture:book.contents.19=§l毛绒玩具：§r多种生物的可爱毛绒玩具！新增犰狳、猫、狼、狐狸和哞菇。
xp_furniture:book.contents.20=§l炉灶与平底锅：§r使用煤与炉灶交互即可点燃炉灶。放入平底锅和生食即可烹饪！

##Page 7 2.0 Update
xp_furniture:book.contents.21=§l可放置食物：§r所有现有食物均新增为可放置物品！物品栏新增可食用的南瓜派切片。
xp_furniture:book.contents.22=§l树苗：§r新增六种树苗，包括柳树、山茱萸和紫藤！

##Page 8 2.0 Update
xp_furniture:book.contents.23=§l悬挂树叶：§r新增紫藤、金链花和柳树的悬挂树叶！
xp_furniture:book.contents.24=§l浇水壶：§r可放置的装饰性浇水壶。浇水壶现在可以装水并用于浇灌植物。

##Page 9 2.0 Update
xp_furniture:book.contents.25=§l屋顶类型：§r2.0 新增铜制屋顶及会自动连接的新屋檐尖端方块！
xp_furniture:book.contents.26=§l宠物床：§r为心爱宠物准备的舒适床铺，提供所有染料颜色。宠物现在可坐在床中恢复生命。

##Page 10 Update
xp_furniture:book.contents.27=§l乐器：§r新增一系列可演奏乐器，包括钢琴和排箫！
xp_furniture:book.contents.28=§l水族箱：§r为水生宠物打造的温馨家园。可用水桶加水，或用装有鱼的桶放入鱼类；新增美西螈和蝌蚪！

##Page 11 Update
xp_furniture:book.contents.29=§l蝴蝶和蛾：§r新增可用捕虫网捕捉的蝴蝶和蛾。
xp_furniture:book.contents.30=§l捕虫网：§r新增捕虫网，可用于攻击或捕捉蝴蝶和蛾。

##Page 12 Update
xp_furniture:book.contents.31=§l石墙和石台阶：§r安山岩、方解石、闪长岩和花岗岩墙新增两种尺寸。
xp_furniture:book.contents.32=§l木板：§r各种木材新增木板变种，现已加入苍白橡木变种！

##Page 13 Update
xp_furniture:book.contents.33=§l工具架：§r使用这款实用架子整理和展示工具。现在可放入钓鱼竿、三叉戟和弓！
xp_furniture:book.contents.34=§l台灯：§r各种木材的台灯。交互即可开启或关闭。

##Page 14 Update
xp_furniture:book.contents.35=§l书堆：§r水平或垂直堆叠的两本书。现在可以另外堆叠两本书。
xp_furniture:book.contents.36=§l遮阳伞：§r三种颜色的彩色遮阳伞，非常适合晴天。现在可以关闭和打开遮阳伞。

##Page 15 Indoor Furniture
xp_furniture:book.contents.37=§l大号床：§r各种木材和颜色的大型、精致、舒适床铺。天黑后与其交互即可跳过夜晚。
xp_furniture:book.contents.38=§l桌子：§r提供多种样式与尺寸的桌子，从小型桌子到大得足以容纳整只嗅探兽的桌子。

##Page 16 Indoor Furniture
xp_furniture:book.contents.39=§l椅子和凳子：§r各种木材的舒适椅子和凳子。交互即可坐下。
xp_furniture:book.contents.40=§l沙发：§r各种颜色的舒适沙发，可容纳三名玩家。与沙发任意位置交互即可坐下。

##Page 17 Indoor Furniture
xp_furniture:book.contents.41=§l扶手椅和坐垫：§r各种颜色的舒适扶手椅和富有弹性的坐垫。交互即可坐下。
xp_furniture:book.contents.42=§l长凳：§r各种木材的宽敞长凳，可容纳两名玩家。与长凳任意位置交互即可坐下。

##Page 18 Indoor Furniture
xp_furniture:book.contents.43=§l床头柜：§r各种木材的紧凑床头柜。交互即可打开储物空间。
xp_furniture:book.contents.44=§l扫帚：§r用木头和干草制成的简易展示用扫帚。

##Page 19 Indoor Furniture
xp_furniture:book.contents.45=§l地球仪：§r装饰性地球仪提供彩色与木雕两种款式。交互即可转动地球仪。
xp_furniture:book.contents.46=§l落地钟：§r两种尺寸和木材的庄重大钟，可显示准确时间并在指定时间报时。

##Page 20 Indoor Furniture
xp_furniture:book.contents.47=§l瓮：§r各种形状和尺寸的装饰性瓮。
xp_furniture:book.contents.48=§l望远镜：§r普通望远镜的装饰性大号版本。

##Page 21 Indoor Furniture
xp_furniture:book.contents.49=§l相机：§r立式相机可拍摄独特照片，并可将照片展示在相框中。交互即可拍照。
xp_furniture:book.contents.50=§l相框：§r由相机获得的拍立得照片制成的可放置相片。

##Page 22 Indoor Furniture
xp_furniture:book.contents.51=§l箱子和衣柜：§r两种新箱子和各种木材的精美衣柜！交互即可打开其物品栏。
xp_furniture:book.contents.52=§l展示柜：§r展示柜可展示贵重物品。手持物品交互即可将其放入展示。

##Page 23 Indoor Furniture
xp_furniture:book.contents.53=§l落地灯和吊灯：§r各种木材的落地灯和吊灯。交互即可开启或关闭。
xp_furniture:book.contents.54=§l房间分隔板：§r时尚的分隔板有两种款式，用于分隔房间内的空间。

##Page 24 Indoor Furniture
xp_furniture:book.contents.55=§l地毯：§r装饰性地毯拥有八种独特图案。
xp_furniture:book.contents.56=§l枝形烛台、吊灯和烛台：§r多种外观和材质的烛台。使用打火石点燃！

##Page 25 Kitchen
xp_furniture:book.contents.57=§l操作台与橱柜：§r各种木材的坚固操作台，可放置所有食材。交互即可打开储物空间。
xp_furniture:book.contents.58=§l水槽：§r适用于厨房和浴室的实用水槽。记得经常洗手！

##Page 26 Kitchen
xp_furniture:book.contents.59=§l饼干罐：§r一个用于存放饼干的可爱罐子。拿着饼干进行互动，将其存放在罐子里。
xp_furniture:book.contents.60=§l大锅：§r大号冒泡锅共有三种款式。

##Page 27 Kitchen
xp_furniture:book.contents.61=§l木杯：§r简约的装饰性木杯。将木杯与任何蔬菜结合起来，就可以制成可饮用的果汁杯。

##Page 28 Walls and Hanging Furniture
xp_furniture:book.contents.62=§l置物架：§r各种木材的简易置物架，可展示想炫耀的任何物品。
xp_furniture:book.contents.63=§l窗框：§r各种木材的多功能框架，既可用于窗户，也可作为相框。

##Page 29 Walls and Hanging Furniture
xp_furniture:book.contents.64=§l悬挂地标牌：§r各种木材的悬挂标牌。交互即可切换图案！
xp_furniture:book.contents.65=§l素色和图案壁纸：§r各种颜色的简洁素色壁纸和装饰图案壁纸！

##Page 30 Walls and Hanging Furniture
xp_furniture:book.contents.66=§l窗帘和百叶窗：§r木制可调百叶窗和两种尺寸的优雅窗帘，为窗户增添舒适感。交互即可开关。

##Page 31 Outdoor Furniture
xp_furniture:book.contents.67=§l水泵：§r铁制水泵。交互即可抽水；手持空桶交互即可将其装满水。
xp_furniture:book.contents.68=§l风轮和风铃：§r会随微风摆动的风轮和风铃。

##Page 32 Outdoor Furniture
xp_furniture:book.contents.69=§l吊床和摇椅：§r提供四种颜色的舒适吊床，以及经典的休闲摇椅。交互即可坐下。
xp_furniture:book.contents.70=§l果汁桶：§r普通木桶的加大版。

##Page 33 Outdoor Furniture
xp_furniture:book.contents.71=§l木推车和风车：§r乡村风格的装饰木推车有两种尺寸。大型旋转风车能为景观增添生机。
xp_furniture:book.contents.72=§l水车：§r风景如画的大型水车，非常适合景观区域！仅会在水中转动。

##Page 34 Nature and Garden
xp_furniture:book.contents.73=§l鸡窝：§r将鸡蛋放入鸡窝，只要耐心等待，最终会生成一只鸡。
xp_furniture:book.contents.74=§l落叶和叶堆：§r散落的装饰性落叶与地上的叶堆，非常适合秋日环境。

##Page 35 Nature and Garden
xp_furniture:book.contents.75=§l花盆：§r多种设计的迷人花盆。手持任意植物或花朵交互即可将其放入其中。
xp_furniture:book.contents.76=§l喷泉：§r铁制和闪长岩变种的小喷泉。交互即可开关水流。

##Page 36 Nature and Garden
xp_furniture:book.contents.77=§l原木堆和篮子：§r装饰用原木及能容纳指定食物的实用篮子！
xp_furniture:book.contents.78=§l花箱：§r各种设计的花箱。与任何植物互动，将其放入其中。

##Page 37 Nature and Garden
xp_furniture:book.contents.79=§l生长灯：§r适合室内园艺区的装饰性铜制生长灯。交互即可切换。
xp_furniture:book.contents.80=§l稻草人和干草堆：§r装饰性稻草人和干草堆，可陪伴你的农作物。

##Page 38 Nature and Garden
xp_furniture:book.contents.81=§l洒水器：§r帮助种植农作物的实用洒水器。用水桶加水后交互即可启动。
xp_furniture:book.contents.82=§l树叶方块：§r更多装饰性树叶方块可用于植被茂盛的环境。

##Page 39 Nature and Garden
xp_furniture:book.contents.83=§l农作物：§r种植多种新作物，如番茄和甜椒。种子可从家具商人处购买。
xp_furniture:book.contents.84=§l植物：§r植物种类繁多，包括大型和小型植物。可从家具商人处购买。

##Page 40 Building and Decor
xp_furniture:book.contents.85=§l装饰性楼梯和门框：§r各种木材的单门、双门门框及新楼梯变种！
xp_furniture:book.contents.86=§l绳索和管道：§r可攀爬的绳索与采用自定义连接系统的装饰管道！

##Page 41 Building and Decor
xp_furniture:book.contents.87=§l装饰性栅栏与栅栏门：§r各种木材的新装饰性栅栏和栅栏门。交互即可开关栅栏门。
xp_furniture:book.contents.88=§l横梁和支撑柱：§r各种木材的木制支撑柱和连接横梁。

##Page 42 Building and Decor
xp_furniture:book.contents.89=§l可放置物品：§r各种常规物品均可放置在周围，为环境增添细节。
xp_furniture:book.contents.90=§l栅条门：§r一扇可从两侧上锁的巨大沉重门。潜行并交互即可上锁或解锁。

##Page 43 Building and Decor
xp_furniture:book.contents.91=§l屋顶瓦与镶边玻璃：§r多种屋顶瓦，以及装饰玻璃方块和带彩色镶边的斜屋顶方块。
xp_furniture:book.contents.92=§l新小径：§r可选择三种由木头、石头和砖块制成的新小径。

##Page 44 Building and Decor
xp_furniture:book.contents.93=§l石材种类与砖纹方块：§r为安山岩、闪长岩等各类石材新增更多建筑方块，以及多种材料组合的砖纹设计。

## xp_furniture:book.name=Guide to FURNITURE Add-On 	## The word "FURNITURE" is not an abbreviation for anything, please translate it as is -- and keep the capitalization intact when applicable.
## xp_furniture:book.contents.0=WELCOME TO FURNITURE! 	## This text is presented at the beginning of the book.
## xp_furniture:book.contents.1=made by XP GAMES	## "XP GAMES" is the name of the author. Do not need to be translated
## xp_furniture:book.contents.2=This add-on brings tons of new furniture, blocks and features to your very own world that you can explore and interact with. Enjoy your creative journey!	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.3=§lObtaining Furniture§r	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.4=You can use the crafting table recipe book to view the available furnitures you can craft in survival mode, or simply by getting them in the creative inventory.	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.5=§lFurniture Merchant§r	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.6=A new merchant has set foot in your world! Make sure not to miss his trades on furniture, crops and plants when he pays you a visit.	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.7=§lFurniture§r	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.8=The next following pages contains a list of all the furniture props and other items this pack has in store for you...	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.9=§lQueen-Sized Bed§r	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.10=Bigger, fancier and cozier beds in all wood types and colors. Interact when it's dark and skip the night.      
## xp_furniture:book.contents.11=§lTable§r	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.12=Tables in various styles and sizes, ranging from small to fits-an-entire-sniffer-big.	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.13=§lChair§r	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.14=Comfortable chairs in all wood types. Interact to sit.	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.15=§lStool§r
## xp_furniture:book.contents.16=Simple and versatile stools in all wood types. Interact to sit.	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.17=§lSofa§r	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.18=Cozy sofas in all colors with room for three players. Interact to sit anywhere on the sofa.	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.19=§lArmchair§r
## xp_furniture:book.contents.20=Incredibly comfy armchairs in all colors. Interact to sit.	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.21=§lBench§r	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.22=Spacious benches in all wood types with room for two players. Interact to sit anywhere on the bench.	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.23=§lWardrobe§r	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.24=Fancy wardrobes in all wood types that can be used to store items in. Interact to open its storage.	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.25=§lBedside Tables§r
## xp_furniture:book.contents.26=Compact bedside tables in all wood types. Interact to open the its storage.	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.27=§lCounter & Cabinet§r
## xp_furniture:book.contents.28=Sturdy work surfaces in all wood types, holding all your ingredients. Interact to open the its storage.	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.29=§lSink§r	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.30=Functional sinks for kitchens and bathrooms. Be sure to regularly wash your hands!	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.31=§lShelf§r	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.32=Simple shelves in all wood types for displaying any items you might want to show off.	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.33=§lLamp§r	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.34=Ceiling lamps in all wood types giving off warm light. Interact to turn on and off.	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.35=§lStanding Lamp§r	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.36=Cozy standing lamps in all wood. Interact to turn on and off.	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.37=§lCushion§r	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.38=Soft and bouncy cushion in all colors. Interact to sit.	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.39=§lCarpet§r	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.40=Decorative carpets with 8 different unique patterns.	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.41=§lWindow Frame§r	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.42=Versatile frames in all wood types, whether it be for windows or as a picture frame.	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.43=§lDoor Frame§r	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.44=Simple door frames in all wood types for both single and double doors.	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.45=§lDecorative Stairs§r	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.46=A new stair variant in all wood types. 	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.47=§lDecorative Fence & Gate§r	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.48=A new fence and fence gate variant in all wood types. Interact to open and close the gate.	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.49=§lBeam§r	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.50=Sturdy beams made of iron or of all wood types.	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.51=§lSupport§r	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.52=Wooden supports in all wood types to properly sustain all your foundations.	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.53=§lBook Piles§r	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.54=Two books stacked horizontally or vertically.	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.55=§lBroom§r	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.56=A simple broom for display made out of wood and hay.	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.57=§lCandle Holder§r	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.58=Elegant candle holders in dark and bright iron variants. Interact to light or extinguish the candle.	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.59=§lCandelabra§r	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.60=Standing candelabras in gold and iron variants. Interact to light or extinguish the candles.	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.61=§lChandelier§r	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.62=Hanging chandeliers in gold and iron variants. Interact to light or extinguish the candles.	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.63=§lChicken Nest§r	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.64=Place an egg into the chicken nest and with enough patience, a chicken will eventually spawn.	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.65=§lFallen Leaves§r	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.66=Decorative scattered leaves, perfect for autumn settings.	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.67=§lFlowerpot§r	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.68=Charming flower pots in various designs. Interact while holding any plant or flower to place them inside.	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.69=§lFountain§r	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.70=Little water fountains in iron and diorite variants. Interact to turn water on and off.	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.71=§lGlobe§r	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.72=Decorative globes both in colored and wood-carved variants. Interact to spin the globe.	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.73=§lGrandfather Clock§r	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.74=Majestic clocks in two sizes and wood types, showing you the right time and ringing at designated times.	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.75=§lHaystack§r	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.76=Decorative full haystacks that can be placed sideways as well.	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.77=§lInstruments§r	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.78=A range of playable musical instruments, including bongos, a harp and a ukulele. Interact to play a note.	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.79=§lLeaf Pile§r	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.80=A pile of leaves sitting on the ground. 	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.81=§lLog Stack§r	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.82=Neatly stacked logs, ready for the fireplace.	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.83=§lPlushies§r	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.84=Adorable plushies of various mobs like the sheep, creeper or enderman.	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.85=§lParasol§r	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.86=Colorful parasols in three colors, perfect for sunny days.	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.87=§lPlaceable Objects§r	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.88=Various regular items that can be placed around for added detail.	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.89=§lFlower Box§r	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.90=Planter boxes in various different designs. Interact while holding any plant or flower to place them inside.	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.91=§lRock Path§r	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.92=Three new paths to choose from, made of wood, stone and bricks.	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.93=§lRope§r	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.94=Decorational ropes with a flexible placement system.	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.95=§lRoom Divider§r	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.96=Stylish dividers in two variants to separate spaces within rooms.	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.97=§lPlants§r	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.98=A big variety of plants, including large and small plants as well as water plants and cacti. Purchasable from the furniture merchant.	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.99=§lUrns§r	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.100=Various decorative urns in different shapes and sizes.	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.101=§lWater Pump§r	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.102=An iron water pump. Interact to pump water, interact while holding an empty bucket to fill it with water.	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.103=§lWind Wheel§r	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.104=A cute little wind wheel spinning in the breeze.	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.105=§lWatering Can§r	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.106=A decorative placeable watering can.	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.107=§lAquarium§r	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.108=A sweet home for your aquatic pets. Fill with water buckets, place fish inside the aquarium with any fish in a bucket.	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.109=§lBarred Door§r	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.110=A huge, heavy door that can be locked from both sides. Sneak + Interact to lock and unlock.	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.111=§lBaskets§r	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.112=Decorative baskets with an empty and three variants filled with vegetables.	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.113=§lBlinds§r	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.114=Wooden adjustable blinds. Interact to close and open.	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.115=§lCurtains§r	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.116=Elegant curtains in two sizes to add a cozy touch to windows. Interact to close and open.	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.117=§lCamera§r	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.118=A standing camera that snaps unique photos that can be displayed in picture frames. Interact to snap a photo.	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.119=§lPicture Frame§r	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.120=Placeable pictures made of the photos you receive from the camera.	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.121=§lCauldron§r	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.122=A big bubbly cauldron in three different variants.	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.123=§lChests§r	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.124=Two new chest variants to store your items in. Interact to access its inventory.	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.125=§lCookie Jar§r	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.126=A cute jar for storing cookies. Interact while holding a cookie to store it inside the jar.	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.127=§lDisplay Case§r	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.128=Wooden and metal display cases to showcase your valuable items. Interact while holding an item to showcase it.	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.129=§lGrow Lamp§r	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.130=A decorative copper lamp for your indoor gardening areas. Interact to turn on and off.	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.131=§lHanging Landmark Sign§r	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.132=Rustic hanging signs in all wood types with many symbols to choose from by interacting.	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.133=§lJuice Barrel§r	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.134=The bigger brother of the regular barrel.	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.135=§lTelescope§r	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.136=The decorational bigger brother of the regular spyglass.	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.137=§lHammock§r	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.138=A cozy hammock in 4 different colors. Interact to sit.	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.139=§lMug§r	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.140=A simple decorative wooden mug. Combining the mug with any vegetable crafts it into a drinkable Juice Mug.	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.141=§lPet Bed§r	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.142=A comfy bed for your beloved pets available in all dye colors.	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.143=§lPipe§r
## xp_furniture:book.contents.144=Decorative pipes in copper and iron variants.	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.145=§lRocking Chair§r	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.146=A classic rocking chair for relaxation. Interact to sit.	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.147=§lScarecrow§r	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.148=A decorative scarecrow keeping your crops some company.	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.149=§lSprinkler§r	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.150=A functional sprinkler to grow your crops. Fill with water bucket and interact to start the sprinkler.	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.151=§lStove§r	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.152=A functional stove in different variants. Interact with coal to turn on, interact with any food item to cook it.	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.153=§lTool Rack§r	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.154=Organize and display your tools with this handy rack.	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.155=§lWood Cart§r	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.156=A rustic decorative cart in two different sizes.	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.157=§lWater Wheel§r	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.158=A picturesque big water wheel, great for scenic spots. Only turns in water.	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.159=§lWindmill§r	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.160=A big rotating windmill to add life to your scenery.	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.161=§lCrops§r	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.162=Grow a variety of new crops like tomatoes and bell peppers. Seeds purchasable from the furniture merchant.	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.163=§lTrim Glass§r	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.164=Decorative glass blocks as well as slanted roof blocks with colored trims.	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.165=§lRoof Tiles§r	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.166=Various types of different roof tiles. 	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.167=§lWood Planks§r	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.168=Additional wooden plank variants in all wood types.	##
