## xp_furniture:book.contents.172=Tiled designs of several different material combinations.	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.173=§lPlain Wallpaper§r	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.174=Simple wallpapers in all colors for a clean look.	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.175=§lPattern Wallpaper§r	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.176=Decorative wallpapers in all colors with each color having a unique pattern.	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.177=§lLeaf Blocks§r	##
## xp_furniture:book.contents.178=More decorative leaf blocks to add to your vegetation heavy environments	##

